    "created_at": "2019-09-04T12:26:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-04T12:26:54Z",
    "body": "At least in Chrome, `.complete` returns false if the \"update the image data\" task is queued at all (and they queue it in all sorts of cases when they should not; see <https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1000273>).\r\n\r\nIt would make some sense to return false for `.complete` if we have reached step 7 of the update the image data steps, I suspect... as long as we don't do it in the cases that would return early in step 10 and maybe step 11?  Unclear.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
