    "created_at": "2019-10-22T12:39:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-22T12:47:17Z",
    "body": "I think I see now, the problem is that https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-image-data does not update any state on the image element synchronously when an asynchronous fetch is to be performed and therefore `complete` might still return the wrong value as it only uses such state.\r\n\r\nI think this is related to some other problems with the `img` element about it being unclear whether it should use \"await a stable state\". Parsing that URL that late is also somewhat problematic from a blob URL perspective, for instance. (#2429 as @EdgarChen referenced already.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
